From c85a668b4bd8179a84e2d675a452d2bbfa300f4b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tanmay Varun <varuntanmay21@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 13 Aug 2026 16:02:20 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] feat(agent): Stage A TUI cutover onto generic AgentRuntime
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Route all ordinary TUI turns through TaskRequest → TaskIngress →
AgentRuntime. Keep runtime domain-generic; method catalogs via providers;
quality orthogonal to MethodAvailability/readiness; resumable ASK; force
ComputerUse via ExecutionConstraints rather than a harness branch.

Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>
